node.doctext:
As documented in [METAMOD://MP3::Info] , the functions <c>get_mp3info</c> and <c>get_mp3tag</c> don't return hashes, but hash references. Either store them in scalars, or dereference them to store them in hashes:
<c>
    my $info = get_mp3info($file);
    for my $key (keys %$info) {
</c>
or
<c>
    my %info = %{ get_mp3info($file) };
    for my $key (keys %info) {
</c>
